        "description": "Mints a user token for testing. This endpoint exists only while USER_MANAGEMENT_URL is unset - it stands in for User Management's POST /users/login, which will issue the real RS256 token. The service verifies tokens the same way either way.\n\nRun this FIRST: every other request sends the token as Authorization: Bearer."
      },
      "response": []
